   148.3 ? relay6=no  "This game uses MINIVAC to judge which of two players has the faster reaction time. When lights 3 and 4 come on, each player tries to push his pushbutton down first. MINIVAC will indicate a winner, and will also indicate a foul—that is, when a player moves before the signal lights (3 and 4) come on."
